            {
              "id": "iac.terraform.open-security-group",
              "name": "ImproperAccessControl",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Security group 'admin' allows ingress from the whole internet on an administrative or database port."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Security group 'admin' allows ingress from the whole internet on an administrative or database port. Access to a resource is not restricted to authorised actors."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Enforce authorisation on the server for every request: check that the authenticated principal owns or may act on the referenced object (deny by default), derive the owner from the session rather than from request parameters, and centralise the check in a decorator or policy layer so no handler can skip it.\n\nCentralise access control and test it with negative cases.",
                "markdown": "**Fix now.** Enforce authorisation on the server for every request: check that the authenticated principal owns or may act on the referenced object (deny by default), derive the owner from the session rather than from request parameters, and centralise the check in a decorator or policy layer so no handler can skip it.\n\n**Prevent recurrence.** Centralise access control and test it with negative cases."
