            {
              "id": "iac.terraform.public-database",
              "name": "ExposureOfResourceToWrongSphere",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Database 'ledger' is publicly accessible."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Database 'ledger' is publicly accessible. A resource such as a port, bucket or service is exposed beyond its intended audience."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Do not write secrets, credentials, tokens or personal data to logs, error messages or URLs. Mask or omit sensitive fields at the logging boundary, return generic error messages to clients, and keep detailed diagnostics server-side.\n\nDefine exposure in reviewed infrastructure as code with deny-by-default policies.",
                "markdown": "**Fix now.** Do not write secrets, credentials, tokens or personal data to logs, error messages or URLs. Mask or omit sensitive fields at the logging boundary, return generic error messages to clients, and keep detailed diagnostics server-side.\n\n**Prevent recurrence.** Define exposure in reviewed infrastructure as code with deny-by-default policies."
              },
