              "id": "iac.actions.write-all-permissions",
              "name": "ExecutionWithUnnecessaryPrivileges",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The workflow grants write-all permissions to the token."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The workflow grants write-all permissions to the token. A process, container or job runs with more privileges than its function requires, for example as root or with a privileged container flag."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Ship secure defaults: disable debug mode in production, set Secure, HttpOnly and SameSite on session cookies, expire sessions, verify TLS certificates, and restrict CORS to the origins that need it.\n\nEnforce least privilege with admission policies (for example Pod Security Standards) and image linting in CI.",
                "markdown": "**Fix now.** Ship secure defaults: disable debug mode in production, set Secure, HttpOnly and SameSite on session cookies, expire sessions, verify TLS certificates, and restrict CORS to the origins that need it.\n\n**Prevent recurrence.** Enforce least privilege with admission policies (for example Pod Security Standards) and image linting in CI."
