                "text": "Use current, vetted primitives from a maintained library: AES-GCM or ChaCha20-Poly1305 for encryption with a fresh random nonce per message, SHA-256 or better for integrity, a password hashing function (Argon2id, scrypt, bcrypt) for passwords, and the operating system CSPRNG (Python secrets / os.urandom) for keys, tokens and IVs.\n\nClassify data and enforce encryption requirements per class.",
