            {
              "id": "iac.docker.unpinned-base-image",
              "name": "UseOfUnmaintainedThirdPartyComponents",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Base image uses the floating 'latest' tag or no tag, so builds are not reproducible and may pull an unreviewed image."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Base image uses the floating 'latest' tag or no tag, so builds are not reproducible and may pull an unreviewed image. A component is unpinned or no longer maintained, so fixes may never arrive and the version that is built can change without review."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Bind request data only to an explicit allow-list of fields (DTOs), never merge untrusted objects into prototypes or configuration, and load code and libraries only from fixed, trusted locations.\n\nMaintain an approved-components list and monitor upstream health.",
                "markdown": "**Fix now.** Bind request data only to an explicit allow-list of fields (DTOs), never merge untrusted objects into prototypes or configuration, and load code and libraries only from fixed, trusted locations.\n\n**Prevent recurrence.** Maintain an approved-components list and monitor upstream health."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1104.html",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
