            {
              "id": "iac.actions.unpinned-action",
              "name": "InclusionOfFunctionalityFromUntrustedControlSphere",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Action reference in job 'build' is not pinned to a commit SHA, so a moved tag changes what runs."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Action reference in job 'build' is not pinned to a commit SHA, so a moved tag changes what runs. The build or runtime executes code from a source outside the trust boundary, such as an untrusted pull request in a privileged CI workflow or an unpinned third-party action."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Bind request data only to an explicit allow-list of fields (DTOs), never merge untrusted objects into prototypes or configuration, and load code and libraries only from fixed, trusted locations.\n\nSeparate untrusted builds from privileged jobs and review CI configuration as code.",
                "markdown": "**Fix now.** Bind request data only to an explicit allow-list of fields (DTOs), never merge untrusted objects into prototypes or configuration, and load code and libraries only from fixed, trusted locations.\n\n**Prevent recurrence.** Separate untrusted builds from privileged jobs and review CI configuration as code."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/829.html",
